        {
            "id": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/theres-a-certain-slant-of-light.html",
            "url": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/theres-a-certain-slant-of-light.html",
            "title": "There&#x27;s a Certain Slant of Light",
            "summary": "There's a certain Slant of light, Winter Afternoons - That oppresses, like the Heft Of Cathedral Tunes - Heavenly Hurt, it gives us - We can find no scar, But internal difference - Where the Meanings, are - — Emily Dickinson",
            "content_html": "<p>There's a certain Slant of light, <br>Winter Afternoons - <br>That oppresses, like the Heft <br>Of Cathedral Tunes - </p>\n<p>Heavenly Hurt, it gives us - <br>We can find no scar, <br>But internal difference - <br>Where the Meanings, are -</p>\n<p>— Emily Dickinson</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/165/lightwoman-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"663\"></figure>",
